      "widgets_values": [
        "# Attention Lab\n\nTwo facades of the same mechanism: **Attention Optimizer (Auto)** benchmarks every attention backend this machine can actually run (a backend that imports but crashes never gets tried), picks the fastest one and attaches it to this MODEL branch - results are cached, so re-running is free. **Attention Backend (Manual)** pins one backend by hand and explains what it does - use it to A/B the auto choice. Pick any checkpoint in the loader, press **Queue**, and read the timing table / explanation in the two Save Text nodes (also written to `output/comfydl/`)."
